igger Hässelby familjehotell, som vid invigningen 1955 var byggmästaren Olle Engkvists största kollektivhus. Den professionella servicen lades ner 1976, men de boende driver fortfarande viss verksamhet ideellt. Tack för att du åkte med!","tips":[["Hässelby familjehotell","5 min"]],"dur":31.5,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Prisma_H%C3%A4sselby_2013.jpg/1280px-Prisma_H%C3%A4sselby_2013.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Prisma_H%C3%A4sselby_2013.jpg","title":"Prisma Hässelby 2013"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/H%C3%A4sselby_Familjehotell_2010f.jpg/1280px-H%C3%A4sselby_Familjehotell_2010f.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:H%C3%A4sselby_Familjehotell_2010f.jpg","title":"Hässelby Familjehotell 2010f"}],"audio":"audio/piper/e6987caf0b583854.mp3"}],"looks":[],"from":"Hässelby gård","to":"Hässelby gård","variant":"Mot Hässelby gård","color":["#d71d24","#ffffff"],"trips":7,"source":"SL via Trafiklab (GTFS Regional)","tts":"Piper"}